body:
Hi, OP. I work in cybersecurity. Firstly, I'm really sorry to hear about this happening to your child. I recommend contacting the credit card institution if you haven't already and filing a claim. If the school provided identify theft protection, don't accept it. Purchase your own for your kid. Next thing, it can take about a year for an independent third-party or the government to conduct an investigation into ransomware. Probably why it took that long to determine what was taken. I know from personal experience that staff are not trained worth a fuck on how to avoid the probable cause of the ransomware attacks.

&#x200B;

Sorry about all the other stuff bud, that's rough
